    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/3fe5f1e03c2cdc22ca06a8bb15050eb8.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=107 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/8c36a66b8413ec5ab3e8c8f86485f5b8.poster.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/8c36a66b8413ec5ab3e8c8f86485f5b8.webm?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/8c36a66b8413ec5ab3e8c8f86485f5b8.mp4?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Enlist as an agent of PEWA (The Penguin Egg Watch Agency) and travel the world in this fast-paced third-person adventure shooter. Your mission is clear: retrieve and protect penguin eggs from mischievous Icy Land creatures who dared to steal them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/f0ad0707363aeff2071236fc94f2ea20.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=107 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/f842f38f01561b1abe31970757d5bf4e.poster.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/f842f38f01561b1abe31970757d5bf4e.webm?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/f842f38f01561b1abe31970757d5bf4e.mp4?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Every egg you save hatches into an active squad member, possessing different fighting abilities. They have it all \u2013 from expert target detection and close combat mastery to the power of healing energy and wizard protection to aid you in this fierce battle for penguins\u2019 future.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/589f166309ce0b09b40eaecd27cb9831.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=107 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/d547aa5af917383b0f8d69896e5f8025.poster.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/d547aa5af917383b0f8d69896e5f8025.webm?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/d547aa5af917383b0f8d69896e5f8025.mp4?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Upgrade your skills to grow stronger. Equip yourself with an array of powerful weapons and strategic maneuvers: launch rockets, use blades, lasers, and chargeable special weapons to launch devastating all-sweeping attacks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/aaabd880f455ddd9c20a4f41ee1335d2.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=107 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/eeb33d88af12564b7b1389db9b080198.poster.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/eeb33d88af12564b7b1389db9b080198.webm?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/eeb33d88af12564b7b1389db9b080198.mp4?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Fight your way through hordes of enemies \u2013 encounter Ice Spiders, clumsy Snowfoots, one-eyed monsters, and other creatures from the depths of the night! Some foes you\u2019ll confront up close, while others require long-range tactics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/e39e14568aa5cde510cbb24a800d4453.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=107 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/7e8bae94ac30ae9f0775deb07fa654be.poster.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/7e8bae94ac30ae9f0775deb07fa654be.webm?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/7e8bae94ac30ae9f0775deb07fa654be.mp4?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Suit up for the ultimate challenge as you confront the generals of Icy Land creatures! Striking with deadly force, they\u2019ll push you to give it your all. Gear up for epic battles and fight to retrieve stolen eggs. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/8a459cf5207e42e0a1935ef515d8a2b4.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=107 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/e1caf11c2155cc32e0ffbc49d028623b.poster.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/e1caf11c2155cc32e0ffbc49d028623b.webm?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/e1caf11c2155cc32e0ffbc49d028623b.mp4?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This mission will take you across the world, from tropical rainforests to the icy North Pole. Don\u2019t want to travel alone? Bring a friend along to team up and defeat your enemies together.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/3fe5f1e03c2cdc22ca06a8bb15050eb8.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=107 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/8c36a66b8413ec5ab3e8c8f86485f5b8.poster.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/8c36a66b8413ec5ab3e8c8f86485f5b8.webm?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/8c36a66b8413ec5ab3e8c8f86485f5b8.mp4?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Enlist as an agent of PEWA (The Penguin Egg Watch Agency) and travel the world in this fast-paced third-person adventure shooter. Your mission is clear: retrieve and protect penguin eggs from mischievous Icy Land creatures who dared to steal them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/f0ad0707363aeff2071236fc94f2ea20.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=107 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/f842f38f01561b1abe31970757d5bf4e.poster.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/f842f38f01561b1abe31970757d5bf4e.webm?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/f842f38f01561b1abe31970757d5bf4e.mp4?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Every egg you save hatches into an active squad member, possessing different fighting abilities. They have it all \u2013 from expert target detection and close combat mastery to the power of healing energy and wizard protection to aid you in this fierce battle for penguins\u2019 future.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/589f166309ce0b09b40eaecd27cb9831.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=107 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/d547aa5af917383b0f8d69896e5f8025.poster.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/d547aa5af917383b0f8d69896e5f8025.webm?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/d547aa5af917383b0f8d69896e5f8025.mp4?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Upgrade your skills to grow stronger. Equip yourself with an array of powerful weapons and strategic maneuvers: launch rockets, use blades, lasers, and chargeable special weapons to launch devastating all-sweeping attacks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/aaabd880f455ddd9c20a4f41ee1335d2.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=107 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/eeb33d88af12564b7b1389db9b080198.poster.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/eeb33d88af12564b7b1389db9b080198.webm?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/eeb33d88af12564b7b1389db9b080198.mp4?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Fight your way through hordes of enemies \u2013 encounter Ice Spiders, clumsy Snowfoots, one-eyed monsters, and other creatures from the depths of the night! Some foes you\u2019ll confront up close, while others require long-range tactics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/e39e14568aa5cde510cbb24a800d4453.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=107 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/7e8bae94ac30ae9f0775deb07fa654be.poster.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/7e8bae94ac30ae9f0775deb07fa654be.webm?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/7e8bae94ac30ae9f0775deb07fa654be.mp4?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Suit up for the ultimate challenge as you confront the generals of Icy Land creatures! Striking with deadly force, they\u2019ll push you to give it your all. Gear up for epic battles and fight to retrieve stolen eggs. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/8a459cf5207e42e0a1935ef515d8a2b4.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=107 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/e1caf11c2155cc32e0ffbc49d028623b.poster.avif?t=1717072346\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/e1caf11c2155cc32e0ffbc49d028623b.webm?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988230/extras/e1caf11c2155cc32e0ffbc49d028623b.mp4?t=1717072346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This mission will take you across the world, from tropical rainforests to the icy North Pole. Don\u2019t want to travel alone? Bring a friend along to team up and defeat your enemies together.",
